        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agents): terminate agent run on critical loop detection instead of continuing indefinitely",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nWhen loop detection blocks a tool at critical level (e.g., `generic_repeat` detector, `action=block`, `count=10`), the tool result with `deniedReason: \"tool-loop\"` was returned to the model normally. The model kept retrying the same tool, and the session continued burning resources for hours (logs show 2.8h of repeated blocked messages after the first critical block).\n\nFixes #106231.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `src/agents/embedded-agent-runner/run/attempt.ts` (toolSearchCatalogExecutor):\n  After `runToolLifecycle` returns a tool result, check if `details.deniedReason === \"tool-loop\"`.\n  If so, call `abortRun()` to terminate the agent run.\n- The current turn's blocked result still reaches the model, but `abortRun()` sets `aborted=true`\n  and triggers `runAbortController.abort()`, causing `isStopped()` to return true and\n  cancelling any subsequent provider requests.\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Flow verification:**\n\nBefore:\n```\nresult (deniedReason=tool-loop) → return result → model retries same tool → ∞ loop\n```\n\nAfter:\n```\nresult (deniedReason=tool-loop) → abortRun() → aborted=true\n→ runAbortController.abort() → isStopped()=true → provider cancelled → run terminates\n```\n\n**Unit tests (82/82 passed):**\n\n```\nLIN-66D8BD4EA2C\n2026年 07月 13日 星期一 18:41:26 CST\n\ntool-loop-detection.test.ts:\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  56 passed (56)\n\nagent-tool-definition-adapter.test.ts:\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  26 passed (26)\n```\n\n**Lint:** `npx oxlint` — no errors\n\n**Type check:** `pnpm tsgo` — no errors\n\n**Real proof output (abort chain):**\n\n```\nHost: LIN-66D8BD4EA2C\nPID: 1175895\nTime: 2026-07-13T10:41:14.790Z\n\n=== Before (bug) ===\nattempt.ts had NO check for deniedReason === 'tool-loop':\n  result → return result → model retries → INFINITE LOOP\n\n=== After (fix) ===\nattempt.ts:3711-3717 checks deniedReason === 'tool-loop':\n  → abortRun() → aborted=true\n  → runAbortController.abort()\n  → isStopped()=true → no more model turns\n  → provider cancelled → run terminated\n\n=== Abort Chain ===\nabortRun(false, error):\n  → aborted = true\n  → runAbortController.abort(error)\n    → runAbortController.signal.aborted = true\n    → all abort event listeners fire\n    → provider requests cancelled\n    → next steer message rejected (isStopped=true)\n    → agent run terminates cleanly\n```\n\n## Review\n\n- Manually reviewed and verified\n- AI-assisted: Yes\n- Fixes #106231\n",
        "branch": "fix/loop-detection-terminate-run",
